#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/openstack.rst:2
msgid "Openstack"
msgstr "Openstack"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/openstack.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/openstack.rst:7
msgid ""
"Openstack is becoming a widely used on-premise infrastructure orchestration "
"platform. It has a wide array of contributors and enterprise sponsorships. "
"There are several variations on Openstack as well. |morpheus| supports "
"integration with all the various platform offerings and ranges in support "
"all the way back to Openstack Juno. The complete list of compatible versions"
" is listed in our `Integration Compatibility table "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/release_notes/compatibility.html#integrations>`_."
" It leverages the APIs and provides full functionality as a self service "
"portal in front of Openstack."
msgstr ""
"Openstack es becoming un widely used on-premise infrastructure orchestration"
" platform. It tiene un wide array of contributors y enterprise sponsorships."
" There son several variations on Openstack as well. |morpheus| supports "
"integration con todos el various platform offerings y ranges in support "
"todos el way back to Openstack Juno. The completo lista of compatible "
"versions es listed in our `Integration Compatibility table "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/release_notes/compatibility.html#integrations>`_."
" It leverages el APIs y provides full functionality as un self servicio "
"portal in front of Openstack."

