#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:2
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Primeros pasos"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:4
msgid ""
"OpenStack Clouds are very easy to integrate with |morpheus|. First, go to "
"the ``Infrastructure > Clouds`` section and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Select "
"OpenStack to begin the integration process, most branded flavors of "
"OpenStack will work with this Cloud selection as well."
msgstr ""
"OpenStack Clouds son muy easy to integrate con |morpheus|. First, go to el "
"``Infrastructure > Clouds`` sección y click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`. Select "
"OpenStack to begin la integración proceso, la mayoría branded flavors of "
"OpenStack será work con este Cloud selection as well."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:6
msgid "Support for OpenStack v2 Identity API has been removed in v5.3.3"
msgstr "Support para OpenStack v2 Identity API tiene sido eliminado in v5.3.3"

