#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:50
msgid ""
"Most of the information in the dialog can be acquired from the Openstack "
"dashboard. under ``Project > Access & Security > API Access``. The API URL "
"that is needed is the one tied to `Identity`. The Domain and Project inputs "
"typically correlate to the multitenant domain setup within Openstack "
"(sometimes just left at default) as well as the project name given to "
"instances. |morpheus| allows multiple integrations to the same Openstack "
"cluster to be scoped to various domains and projects as needed."
msgstr ""
"Most of el información in el dialog puede be acquired desde el Openstack "
"dashboard. under ``Project > Access & Security > API Access``. The API URL "
"que es needed es el one tied to `Identity`. The Domain y Project inputs "
"típicamente correlate to el multitenant domain setup dentro de Openstack "
"(sometimes solo left at predeterminado) así como el project nombre given to "
"instances. |morpheus| allows múltiples integrations to el mismo Openstack "
"cluster to be scoped to various domains y projects según sea necesario."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:52
msgid ""
"The remaining options help |morpheus| determine which API capabilities exist"
" in the selected Openstack environment. Hence the need for the Openstack "
"version and image format. If a newer Openstack cluster is being used then "
"exists in the dropdown, simply select the most recent version in the "
"dropdown and this should function sufficiently until the new version is "
"added."
msgstr ""
"The remaining opciones help |morpheus| determine cual API capabilities exist"
" in el seleccionado Openstack entorno. Hence el need para el Openstack "
"versión y image formato. If un newer Openstack cluster es being used "
"entonces exists in el desplegable, simply select el la mayoría recent "
"versión in el desplegable y este debería función sufficiently hasta el nuevo"
" versión es agregado."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:54
msgid ""
"Some Openstack environments do not support QCOW2 and force RAW image formats"
" (like Metapod). This is due to some network overhead in Ceph created by "
"using QCOW2. |morpheus| keeps two copies of Openstack image templates for "
"this exact purpose."
msgstr ""
"Some Openstack entornos no soportan QCOW2 y force RAW image formats (like "
"Metapod). This es due to algunos network overhead in Ceph creado by using "
"QCOW2. |morpheus| keeps two copies of Openstack image templates para este "
"exact purpose."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:56
msgid ""
"Saving this cloud integration should perform a verification step and close "
"upon successful completion."
msgstr ""
"Saving esta nube integration debería perform un verification paso y close "
"sobre exitoso completion."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:59
msgid "Existing Instances"
msgstr "Existing Instances"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:61
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides several features regarding pulling in existing virtual "
"machines and servers in an environment. Most cloud options contain a "
"checkbox titled '*Inventory Existing Instances*'. When this option is "
"selected, all VMs found within the specified scope of the cloud integration "
"will be scanned periodically and Virtual Machines will be synced into "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| provides several características regarding pulling in existente "
"virtual machines y servers in un entorno. Most cloud opciones contain un "
"casilla de verificación titled '*Inventory Existing Instances*'. When este "
"opción es seleccionado, todos VMs found dentro de el especificado scope of "
"la nube integration será be scanned periodically y Virtual Machines será be "
"synced en |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:63
msgid ""
"By default these virtual machines are considered 'unmanaged' and do not "
"appear in the |ProIns| area but rather |InfComVir|. However, a few features "
"are provided with regards to unmanaged instances. They can be assigned to "
"various accounts if using a multitenant master account, however it may be "
"best suited to instead assign the 'Resource Pool' to an account and "
"optionally move all servers with regards to that pool (more on this later)."
msgstr ""
"By predeterminado estos virtual machines son considered 'unmanaged' y no "
"appear in el |ProIns| area pero rather |InfComVir|. Sin embargo, un few "
"características son provided con regards to unmanaged instances. They puede "
"be assigned to various accounts if using un multitenant master cuenta, sin "
"embargo it puede be best suited to en cambio assign el 'Resource Pool' to un"
" cuenta y opcionalmente move todos servers con regards to que pool (más on "
"este later)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:65
msgid ""
"A server can also be made into a managed server. During this process remote "
"access is requested and an agent install is performed on the guest operating"
" system. This allows for guest operations regarding log acquisition and "
"stats. If the agent install fails, a server will still be marked as managed "
"and an Instance will be created in `Provisioning`, however certain features "
"will not function. This includes stats collection and logs."
msgstr ""
"A server puede también be made en un managed server. During este proceso "
"remoto acceso es requested y un agente install es performed on el guest "
"operating sistema. This allows para guest operaciones regarding log "
"acquisition y stats. If el agente install fails, un servidor será aún be "
"marked as managed y un Instance será creado in `Provisioning`, sin embargo "
"certain características no función. This includes stats collection y logs."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:68
msgid "Service Ports"
msgstr "Service Ports"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:70
msgid ""
"|morpheus| consumes the following OpenStack service ports by default as part"
" of its cloud integration. If your OpenStack implementation has been "
"configured to use alternate service ports, these can be overwritten in the "
"Cloud configuration under the Service Endpoints section when adding or "
"editing the Cloud integration."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| consumes el following OpenStack servicio ports por defecto as "
"part of its cloud integration. If your OpenStack implementation tiene sido "
"configurado to use alternate servicio ports, estos puede be overwritten in "
"el Cloud configuración under el Service Endpoints sección cuando adding o "
"editing el Cloud integration."

msgid ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/openstack/serviceEndpoints.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/openstack/serviceEndpoints.png"

