#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:87
msgid "OpenStack Scalable File Service (SFS)"
msgstr "OpenStack Scalable File Service (SFS)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:89
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| integration with Openstack Cloud includes the capability to "
"work with Openstack Scalable File Service (SFS). SFS is shared file storage "
"hosted on Openstack Cloud. By integrating |morpheus| with Openstack you can "
"discover, create, manage, and delete SFS servers, as well as view and work "
"with the file shares and files contained therein."
msgstr ""
"The |morpheus| integration con Openstack Cloud includes el capability to "
"work con Openstack Scalable File Service (SFS). SFS es shared archivo "
"storage hosted on Openstack Cloud. By integrating |morpheus| con Openstack "
"you puede discover, create, manage, y delete SFS servers, así como view y "
"work con el archivo shares y archivos contained therein."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:92
msgid "SFS Server Discovery and Management"
msgstr "SFS Server Discovery y Management"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:94
msgid ""
"On integrating Openstack Cloud with |morpheus|, SFS servers and file shares "
"are discovered automatically after a short time. The server(s) can be viewed"
" in Infrastructure > Storage > Servers. By viewing the server detail page "
"and clicking :guilabel:`EDIT`, the storage server can be scoped as needed. "
"Administrators can choose to scope to other Openstack Cloud integrations (if"
" more than one relevant integration currently exists), select from synced "
"availability zones, and scope the storage server to specific Tenants if "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"On integrating Openstack Cloud con |morpheus|, SFS servers y archivo shares "
"son discovered automáticamente después de un short time. El servidor(s) se "
"puede ver in Infrastructure > Storage > Servers. By viewing el servidor "
"página de detalles y clicking :guilabel:`EDITAR`, el storage server puede be"
" scoped según sea necesario. Administrators puede choose to scope to otro "
"Openstack Cloud integrations (if más than one relevante integration "
"actualmente exists), select desde synced availability zones, y scope el "
"storage server to específico Tenants si se desea."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:96
msgid ""
"Additionally, Openstack SFS servers can be created from the storage server "
"list page (Infrastructure > Storage > Servers) directly in |morpheus|. Click"
" :guilabel:`+ADD` to begin and set the storage server type value to "
"\"Openstack SFS\". Just like with existing synced SFS servers, those created"
" from |morpheus| can be scoped as needed."
msgstr ""
"Adicionalmente, Openstack SFS servers se puede crear desde el storage server"
" página de lista (Infrastructure > Storage > Servers) directly in "
"|morpheus|. Click :guilabel:`+ADD` to begin y set el storage server tipo "
"valor to \"Openstack SFS\". Just like con existente synced SFS servers, esos"
" creado desde |morpheus| puede be scoped según sea necesario."

msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/openstack/addSfs.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/openstack/addSfs.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:102
msgid "SFS File Share Discovery and Management"
msgstr "SFS File Share Discovery y Management"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:104
msgid ""
"Discovered file shares will appear among other file shares synced with "
"|morpheus| in Infrastructure > Storage > File Shares. Depending on the "
"number of cloud integrations in your |morpheus| appliance and the number of "
"cloud integrations available to your user account, this list may be quite "
"large. Using the search bar on this page, we can narrow down the list to "
"only file shares whose names match the search terms."
msgstr ""
"Discovered archivo shares será appear among otro archivo shares synced con "
"|morpheus| in Infrastructure > Storage > File Shares. Dependiendo de el "
"número of cloud integrations in your |morpheus| appliance y el número of "
"cloud integrations disponible to your user cuenta, este lista puede be quite"
" large. Using el search bar en esta página, we puede narrow down el lista to"
" solo archivo shares whose names match el search terms."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:106
msgid ""
"We can drill into individual file shares by clicking on the hyperlinked name"
" in the list of all integrated file shares. From the file share detail page,"
" a list of files will appear on the files tab. Begin the process of adding a"
" new file by clicking :guilabel:`+ADD`. The Access tab on the file shares "
"detail page allows users to view and manage ACL rules."
msgstr ""
"We puede drill en individual archivo shares by clicking on el hyperlinked "
"nombre in el lista of todos integrated archivo shares. Desde el archivo "
"share página de detalles, un lista of archivos será appear on el archivos "
"pestaña. Begin el proceso of adding un nuevo archivo by clicking "
":guilabel:`+ADD`. The Access pestaña on el archivo shares página de detalles"
" permite un los usuarios view y manage ACL rules."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:108
msgid ""
"\"Failed to load files from storage provider\" is present when the "
"|morpheus| appliance doesn't have access to the file share."
msgstr ""
"\"Failed to load archivos desde storage proveedor\" es present cuando el "
"|morpheus| appliance doesn't tienen acceso to el archivo share."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:110
msgid ""
"New Openstack SFS file shares can also be created directly in |morpheus|. "
"From the file shares list page, get started by clicking :guilabel:`+ADD`. "
"Select the type \"Openstack SFS Share\". Set the storage service field to a "
"pre-existing Openstack SFS server. Setting a friendly name for the file "
"share in |morpheus| and selecting from synced availability zones is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"New Openstack SFS archivo shares puede también be creado directly in "
"|morpheus|. Desde el archivo shares página de lista, get started by clicking"
" :guilabel:`+ADD`. Seleccione el tipo \"Openstack SFS Share\". Establezca el"
" storage servicio campo to un pre-existente Openstack SFS server. Setting un"
" friendly nombre para el archivo share in |morpheus| y selecting desde "
"synced availability zones es requerido."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:113
msgid "Network and Router Creation"
msgstr "Network y Router Creation"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once an OpenStack Cloud is integrated into |morpheus|, new network creation "
"options become available. When adding a new network (Infrastructure > "
"Networks > Networks Tab), a new type labeled \"OpenStack Private Network\" "
"is available when clicking :guilabel:`+ADD`. When the user creates this "
"network construct in |morpheus|, a layer two subnet is created but it's not "
"connected to a Virtual Private Cloud (VPC). This is by design as an "
"Internet-routable network is not always desired. Continue on with this "
"section after creating the network to also create a VPC (router)."
msgstr ""
"Once un OpenStack Cloud es integrated en |morpheus|, nuevo network creation "
"opciones become disponible. When adding un nuevo network (Infrastructure > "
"Networks > Networks Tab), un nuevo tipo labeled \"OpenStack Private "
"Network\" es disponible cuando clicking :guilabel:`+ADD`. When el usuario "
"creates esta red construct in |morpheus|, un layer two subnet es creado pero"
" it's no conectado to un Virtual Private Cloud (VPC). This es by design as "
"un Internet-routable network no es always desired. Continue on con este "
"sección después de creating la red to también create un VPC (router)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:118
msgid "Create a network"
msgstr "Create una red"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:120
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:130
msgid "Navigate to Infrastructure > Networks"
msgstr "Navegue un Infrastructure > Networks"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:121
msgid "Click on the Networks tab"
msgstr "Haga clic en el Networks pestaña"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:122
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:132
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:123
msgid "Select OpenStack Private Network"
msgstr "Select OpenStack Private Network"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:124
msgid "Complete the modal based on requirements for the new network"
msgstr "Complete el modal basado en requirements para el nuevo network"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:125
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:135
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:128
msgid "Create a router"
msgstr "Create un router"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:131
msgid "Click on the Routers tab"
msgstr "Haga clic en el Routers pestaña"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:133
msgid "Select OpenStack Router"
msgstr "Select OpenStack Router"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:134
msgid "Complete the modal based on requirements for the new router"
msgstr "Complete el modal basado en requirements para el nuevo router"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/getting_started.rst:137
msgid ""
"When creating a router, it's helpful to note that the External Network is "
"the floating IP network that has been assigned to the OpenStack project. "
"This network will grant your Instances their routes out to the Internet. The"
" Internal Subnet can be a layer two subnet that you may have created in the "
"previous step. In addition, multiple subnets can be added to the router "
"(VPC) and the IP address on the subnet would be the router's internal IP "
"address."
msgstr ""
"When creating un router, it's helpful to tenga en cuenta que el External "
"Network es el floating IP network que tiene sido assigned to el OpenStack "
"project. This network será grant your Instances their routes out to el "
"Internet. The Internal Subnet puede be un layer two subnet que you puede "
"tienen creado in el anterior paso. Además, múltiples subnets se puede "
"agregar to el router (VPC) y el IP dirección on el subnet sería be el "
"router's interno IP dirección."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/advanced.rst:2
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Advanced"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/advanced.rst:4
msgid ""
"There are a few advanced features when it comes to provisioning on top of "
"Openstack. Most of these present themselves in the provisioning wizard. This"
" includes OS Volume Type (Local or Volume) which dictates whether the main "
"OS disk is copied and run off the hypervisor or remotely mounted as a volume"
" via Glacier. Some Openstack setups only configure hypervisors with minimal "
"local disks so volume type is needed."
msgstr ""
"There son un few advanced características cuando it comes to provisioning on"
" top of Openstack. Most of estos present themselves in el provisioning "
"wizard. This includes OS Volume Type (Local o Volume) cual dictates whether "
"el main OS disk es copied y run off el hypervisor o remotely mounted as un "
"volume via Glacier. Some Openstack setups solo configure hypervisors con "
"minimal local disks so volume tipo es needed."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/advanced.rst:6
msgid ""
"Another option during provisioning is \"Assign Floating IP\". This option "
"does exactly what it says and is similar to the feature on the Openstack "
"instance dashboard itself. It should be noted that this will attempt to "
"acquire a floating IP from the project and, if out of capacity, will attempt"
" to increase capacity to the project if the cloud credentials provided have "
"sufficient administrative privileges to do so."
msgstr ""
"Another opción durante provisioning es \"Assign Floating IP\". This opción "
"does exactly what it says y es similar to el característica on el Openstack "
"instance dashboard itself. It debería be noted que este será attempt to "
"acquire un floating IP desde el project y, if out of capacity, será attempt "
"to increase capacity to el project if la nube credentials provided tienen "
"sufficient administrative privileges to do so."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:2
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:4
msgid ""
"So far this document has covered how to add the Openstack cloud integration "
"and has described how to provision virtual machine-based Instances via the "
"`Add Instance` catalog in `Provisioning`. Another great feature provided by "
"|morpheus| out of the box is the ability to work with Docker containers and "
"even support multiple containers per Docker host. To do this, a Docker host "
"must first be provisioned into Openstack (multiple hosts are needed when "
"dealing with horizontal scaling scenarios)."
msgstr ""
"So far este document tiene covered how to add el Openstack cloud integration"
" y tiene described how to provision virtual machine-based Instances via el "
"`Add Instance` catalog in `Provisioning`. Another great característica "
"provided by |morpheus| out of el box es el ability to work con Docker "
"containers y incluso support múltiples containers per Docker host. To do "
"este, un Docker host debe primero be provisioned en Openstack (múltiples "
"hosts son needed cuando dealing con horizontal scaling scenarios)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:6
msgid ""
"To provision a Docker Host, navigate to Infrastructure > Clusters and click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD CLUSTER`. Complete the provisioning wizard including "
"selecting the appropriate Group and Cloud. Alternatively, you can navigate "
"to the Clusters tab for a specific Cloud (Infrastructure > Clouds > Specific"
" Cloud detail page > Clusters tab) and begin the process of provisioning a "
"Docker host to that Cloud from there. Once completed, this host will show up"
" in the Hosts sections (Infrastructure > Hosts OR Infrastructure > Clouds > "
"Specific Cloud detail page > Hosts tab). |morpheus| views a Docker host just"
" like any other Hypervisor with the caveat being that it is used for running"
" containerized images instead of virtualized ones."
msgstr ""
"To provision un Docker Host, navigate to Infrastructure > Clusters y click "
":guilabel:`+ AGREGAR CLUSTER`. Complete el provisioning wizard including "
"selecting el apropiado Group y Cloud. Alternatively, you puede navigate to "
"el Clusters pestaña para un específico Cloud (Infrastructure > Clouds > "
"Specific Cloud página de detalles > Clusters pestaña) y begin el proceso of "
"provisioning un Docker host to que Cloud desde allí. Una vez completadod, "
"este host será show up in el Hosts sections (Infrastructure > Hosts OR "
"Infrastructure > Clouds > Specific Cloud página de detalles > Hosts "
"pestaña). |morpheus| views un Docker host solo like cualquier otro "
"Hypervisor con el caveat being que it se utiliza para running containerized "
"images en cambio of virtualized ones."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:8
msgid ""
"Once a Docker Host is successfully provisioned, a green checkmark will "
"appear to the right of the host marking it as available for use. In the "
"event of a failure, click into the relevant host that failed and an error "
"explaining the failure will be displayed in red at the top."
msgstr ""
"Once un Docker Host es successfully provisioned, un green checkmark será "
"appear to el right of el host marking it as disponible para use. En el "
"evento of un failure, click en el relevante host que fallido y un error "
"explaining el failure se mostrará in red en la parte superior."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/openstack/docker.rst:10
msgid ""
"Some common error scenarios include network connectivity. For a Docker Host "
"to function properly, it must be able to resolve the |morpheus| appliance "
"URL which can be configured in |AdmSet|. If it is unable to resolve and "
"negotiate with the appliance, the |morpheus| Agent installation will fail "
"and provisioning instructions will not be able to be issued to the host."
msgstr ""
"Some common error scenarios include network connectivity. For un Docker Host"
" to función properly, it debe be able to resolve el |morpheus| appliance URL"
" cual se puede configurar in |AdmSet|. If it es unable to resolve y "
"negotiate con el appliance, el |morpheus| Agent instalación será fail y "
"provisioning instructions no be able to be issued to el host."
